---
name: Last of the Oaxacans
ingredients:
  - type: Mezcal
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice (1 to 2 limes)
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Luxardo Maraschino
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: 3/4
    amount: Green Chartreuse
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Serrano pepper
    amount: '1'
    unit: slice
    garnish: false
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/last-of-the-oaxacans/image.jpg
sourceUrl: >-
  https://www.seriouseats.com/last-of-the-oaxacans-mezcal-last-word-variation-cocktail-recipe
---
1. Add mezcal, lime juice, maraschino, Chartreuse, and serrano pepper to a cocktail shaker. Fill 2/3 full with ice and shake vigorously until the outside of the shaker begins to frost, about 20 seconds.
1. Double strain into a chilled cocktail glass, garnish with additional pepper slice and serve.
